  "result": "Perfect! All 174 tests pass. I've successfully added the overdue invoice report functionality.\n\n**Changes made:**\n\n1. **src/reports.js** - New reports module:\n   - `overdueInvoices(invoices, asOf)` returns array of overdue invoices:\n     - Filters for status 'issued' or 'partially_paid'\n     - Filters for dueDate < asOf\n     - Returns each invoice as: `{ number, customerId, dueDate, daysOverdue, due }`\n     - Sorted by daysOverdue descending (most overdue first)\n     - Uses `daysBetween()` to calculate days overdue\n     - Uses `balanceDue()` to get current balance owed\n\n2. **test/reports.test.js** - 12 comprehensive tests:\n   - Detecting overdue invoices\n   - Excluding not-yet-due invoices\n   - Excluding invoices due on asOf date\n   - Including partially_paid invoices\n   - Excluding draft invoices\n   - Excluding paid invoices\n   - Sorting by most overdue first\n   - Correct days overdue calculations\n   - Empty array for no overdue invoices\n   - All required fields validation\n   - Due amount calculation with payments\n   - Multiple overdue invoices with varying age\n\n**Key design decisions:**\n- Returns array sorted by days overdue (descending) for easy prioritization\n- Calculates days as exact count using daysBetween utility\n- Includes partially_paid invoices (still owed amount is relevant)\n- Excludes draft (not yet due) and paid (no longer owed) invoices\n- Each report line includes remaining balance to show what's still owed\n\nThe overdue report provides clear visibility into outstanding payment obligations, sorted by urgency for collection efforts.",
